---
// Faith — authentic and elegant, not a church website.
---

<section class="faith section" aria-label="Our foundation of faith">
  <div class="container faith__inner reveal">
    <p class="faith__eyebrow">Our Foundation</p>
    <p class="faith__statement">
      We believe every child is created with <span>value, purpose and dignity</span>,
      and we seek to show the love of Jesus through the way we serve children and
      families.
    </p>
    <p class="faith__verse">
      &ldquo;And now these three remain: faith, hope and love. But the greatest of
      these is love.&rdquo;
      <cite>1 Corinthians 13:13</cite>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faith {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--purple-900), var(--purple-700));
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .faith::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(50% 80% at 15% 0%, rgba(242, 178, 51, 0.18), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(45% 70% at 100% 100%, rgba(242, 178, 51, 0.1), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .faith__inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .faith__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .faith__statement {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.6vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.32;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .faith__statement span {
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .faith__verse {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .faith__verse cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }
</style>
